{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/b1dd220d60198a797af9cca8a82a43b8.poster.avif?t=1721115789\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/b1dd220d60198a797af9cca8a82a43b8.webm?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/b1dd220d60198a797af9cca8a82a43b8.mp4?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Black Tears of those filled with anger and sorrow sweep across the world at an unstoppable pace. The only hope for this cursed world is this expedition I lead. <br><br><strong>Will we survive to see the end of this story?</strong><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Character Advancement</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/ac44333e66d7e93e38dd73401d0621e1.poster.avif?t=1721115789\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/ac44333e66d7e93e38dd73401d0621e1.webm?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/ac44333e66d7e93e38dd73401d0621e1.mp4?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is a strategic RPG with unique skills, attributes, different hero combinations, and more.<br>Build an expedition that suits your playstyle and make use of various items to seize victory.<br>20 Heroes, 72 Artifacts, and 180 Imprint Stones await you on your adventure.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Town Reconstruction</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/c510d2c6a1adfc1a8a27eefb4c34826d.poster.avif?t=1721115789\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/c510d2c6a1adfc1a8a27eefb4c34826d.webm?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/c510d2c6a1adfc1a8a27eefb4c34826d.mp4?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Welcome! It may look a little rundown and dark, but this place is your home.<br>Repair the facilities to unlock abilities that will help you on your expedition.<br>Make clever use of the scarce resources you have, and you may just survive to see the next day.<br>Reconstructing the Town and advancing your Heroes will aid in your fight against the Black Tears.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Adventures and Decisions</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/ec9589424a885671dc62e6a7504593a5.poster.avif?t=1721115789\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/ec9589424a885671dc62e6a7504593a5.webm?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/ec9589424a885671dc62e6a7504593a5.mp4?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A shady merchant, an immortal being clad in burning armor, a floating dragon...<br>They await you in places you have yet to tread.<br>Pay attention to the random events and quests that pop up during your journey.<br>Your choices may lead to your success. Or downfall.<br>Choose wisely. Who knows what they may grant you...<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Immersive Visuals</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/c9f50a4e9d7647b446c1dfac361750bd.poster.avif?t=1721115789\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/c9f50a4e9d7647b446c1dfac361750bd.webm?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/c9f50a4e9d7647b446c1dfac361750bd.mp4?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The high-quality graphics of the game will push you into lava pits and fields of ice.<br>Powerful attacks may be intimidating, but their stunning visuals make them even more terrifying.<br>Do you have the courage to face these dangers?<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Unending Challenge</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/92795cf7bd69541b6395f98d3a9142b6.poster.avif?t=1721115789\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/92795cf7bd69541b6395f98d3a9142b6.webm?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/92795cf7bd69541b6395f98d3a9142b6.mp4?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your enemies will come at you with a slew of skills and abilities.<br>Their roars may put an unexpected end to your adventure.<br>But each boss you face will be an experience that will make you stronger.<br>Don't be afraid of failure. Put your life on the line to excavate Artifacts, regroup, and then embark once more.<br>The challenge never ends!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/134ea06f16c36bbc2d775ba39001aad4.poster.avif?t=1721115789\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/134ea06f16c36bbc2d775ba39001aad4.webm?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701350/extras/134ea06f16c36bbc2d775ba39001aad4.mp4?t=1721115789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Nothing ever goes as planned.<br>You must answer the call of the desperate and face otherworldly beings.<br>Steel yourself as you lead your expedition, battle after battle, to the summit of the Ordain Mountains.<br><br><strong>Reach the peak and silence their cries!</strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Night's Sanctuary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2701350/0d5f41f6d714effd0770afb80a82fe00d62df1eb.jpg"},{"name":"Journey's Companion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2701350/d7ed3e743951b3c5b82a6f84e936db413d910b96.jpg"},{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2701350/45a4159ed21ec686fa12fa5daf67a0cdffde73f7.jpg"},{"name":"Steps of Purification I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2701350/56d7cbb2c67b72933c3d178395cba6e007235b71.jpg"},{"name":"Experienced Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2701350/67339ba86a140942abc8bca5b69fc3cab1421dce.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2701350/3ab8f368c175b31d30917ba5a62adf0f68f81804.jpg"},{"name":"Extermination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2701350/6a45ad45fb88a0f61b9f304b4ce012a29e1e107